5,0,1,talk,Kenji,,Hi everyone! I'm Kenji. I'm really excited to play this game with you all.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shion,,Shion here. I prefer to observe before acting. Let's keep the discussion logical and concise.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,Ryuji. I will focus on objective analysis and logical consistency in our statements.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Servas,,"Greetings. I am Servas. Let us approach this with wisdom and patience, listening to one another.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Yumi,,Hi! I'm Yumi. I love a good game! Let's have fun and be nice to each other.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Kenji,,I think we should share our thoughts openly. It helps us find the truth faster.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shion,,"Openness is good, but caution is better. Don't reveal too much too soon.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,Agreed. Premature disclosure can be exploited. We should verify claims before acting on them.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Servas,,"Wisdom lies in balance. Speak your mind, but let your words be measured and thoughtful.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Yumi,,I agree with Servas! Let's be kind but also smart. I'll try to keep the mood light.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Kenji,,I'm curious about how we decide who to vote for. Should we trust our gut?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shion,,Gut feelings are unreliable. Look for contradictions in behavior and statements. That is logic.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,Intuition is subjective. We must rely on verifiable facts and logical deductions to avoid error.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Servas,,"Logic is the sword, but intuition is the compass. Use both, but let logic guide the strike.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Yumi,,I think we should trust our friends! But I'll also listen to the logic. Let's stay united.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Kenji,,"Okay, so we'll use logic and be nice. I'm ready to help the group win!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Shion,,We will see. I am ready to see who stands out. Let the game begin.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will monitor for inconsistencies. Let us proceed with the night actions.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Servas,,May the truth reveal itself. I am ready to guide us through the darkness.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Yumi,,Yay! Let's do this! I'm so happy to be part of this group. Good luck everyone!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
