39,1,2,talk,Servas,,Let us not rush to judgment. Listen to the silence between the words. Who is hiding?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Yumi,,I really don't like this tension. Can we please focus on finding the real threat together?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I stand by my feeling. Shion is too perfect. It's suspicious. I vote for Shion.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
